            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "The Gift; Hermetic Apprentice; Death Prophecy; Branchidae Prophecy, Gossip, Keen Vision, Luck, Puissant Intellego; Twilight Prone, Weak Spontaneous Magic; Fear (dark). House Virtues/Flaws"
            ^"Personality Traits" STRING "Shy +3"
            ^"Reputations" STRING "Apprentice of Alexander 1 (Hermetic)"
            ^"Combat" STRING "Fist: Init +1, Attack +2, Defense +4, Damage –2"
